  - key: PAYTABLE_LINE_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>50 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>BET PER LINE: 1</color></size>'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Caishen Triple Cash
  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
    value: START
  - key: PAYTABLE_WILD_SYMBOL
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_WILD_DESCRIPTION
    value: '<size=16>

      Appears on reels 2, 3, 4 and 5, and substitutes for
      all symbols except Firecracker Symbols.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_FIRECRACKER_SYMBOL
    value: <style=title><size=32>FIRECRACKER</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_FIRECRACKER_DESCRIPTION
    value: '<size=16>

      Comes in 3 colors: Purple, Red, and Green, matching
      each feature above the reels.

      Appears on all reels and lands with one
      of the following prizes: Credit, Mini, Minor, Major, and Mega.

      Once
      landed, contributes to the respective feature and may randomly trigger Firecracker
      Bonus.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_FIRECRACKER_BONUS
    value: <style=title><size=32>FIRECRACKER BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_FIRECRACKER_BONUS_DESCRIPTION
    value: '<size=16>

      There are 3 types of Firecracker Bonus: Pay Up Spins,
      Double Spins, and Super Spins.

      Each bonus type can be triggered simultaneously
      at a spin.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAY_UP_SPIN_BONUS
    value: <style=title><size=32>PAY UP SPIN BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAY_UP_SPIN_BONUS_DESCRIPTION
    value: "<size=16>\nOnce triggered, awards 5 Free Spins. \r\nOnly Cash and Free
      Spin symbols appear during the Pay Up Bonus.\r\nFree Spin Symbol awards extra
      spins, once landed.\r\nAll landed Cash Symbols gets locked.\r\nPay Up Feature
      may be triggered at the end of each spin, increasing the payout for a random
      number of  Cash  Symbols on the reels.\r\nFree Spin Symbol awards extra spins,
      once landed.\r\nCover all 15 spots with Cash Symbols to win GRAND.\r\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DOUBLE_SPIN_BONUS
    value: <style=title><size=32>DOUBLE SPIN BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DOUBLE_SPIN_BONUS_DESCRIPTION
    value: '<size=16>

      Once triggered, adds 1 extra 3x5 reelset, copying and
      locking on it all triggering Cash Symbols from the initial reelset.

      Awards
      5 Free Spins to each of reelsets.

      Only Cash and Free Spin Symbol appear
      during the Double Spins Bonus.

      Free Spin Symbol awards extra spins,
      once landed.

      All landed Cash Symbols gets locked.

      Cover all
      15 spots on 1 of reelsets with Cash Symbols to win GRAND.

      Only in Double
      Spin Bonus, GRAND can be won TWICE.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SUPER_SPIN_BONUS
    value: <style=title><size=32>SUPER SPIN BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SUPER_SPIN_BONUS_DESCRIPTION
    value: '<size=16>

      Once triggered, awards 5 Free Spins.

      Only Cash,
      Free Spin, and Super Cash symbols appear during the Super Spin Bonus.

      Free
      Spin Symbol awards extra spins, once landed.

      All landed Cash and Super
      Cash symbols gets locked.

      Once Super Cash Symbol lands, it collects
      and locks on it ALL credits from Cash Symbols on the same reelset, EXCEPT Jackpots
      and other Super Cash Symbols.

      Cover all 15 spots on 1 of reelsets with
      Cash Symbols to win GRAND.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=32>LINES</size></style>
  - key: 
    value: 
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>

      5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4
      <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style>

      </size></b>'
